criteria:
Inclusion criteria:

1. Sufficient proficiency in English and/or French to complete online assessment and participate in the program;
2. Sufficient technological ability to navigate web-based content and participate in the assessment and the program (i.e., access to internet, ability to send and receive a message, ability to complete online assessment);
3. Vision sufficient to participate in the program;
4. Aged 50 years and older;
5. Classified as being at increased risk based on one of the following:

5.1. First-degree family history of dementia; 5.2. Formal education at or below 12 years; 5.3. Self-reported 5.3.1. Hypertension 5.3.2. Hypercholesterolemia 5.3.3. High body mass index (\>30 kg/m2) 5.3.4. Physical inactivity (less than 20 to 30 minutes of physical activity, 2 times a week).

Exclusion criteria

1. Persons with a diagnosis of dementia (based on self-report).
2. Persons who have participated or are currently participating in other studies involving BHPRO.
